[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0433","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0433.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0987","title":"Nathan Neulinger CGIWrap 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"CGIWrap 2.x及3.7之前版本存在跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向CGIWrap发送特制请求，将恶意JavaScript代码注入到CGIWrap生成的错误消息中，当其他用户访问包含恶意内容的错误页面时，脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等危害。攻击无需认证，利用难度低，影响所有使用受影响CGIWrap版本的Web服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0987"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:21Z","remediation":"升级到 CGIWrap 3.7 或更高版本（最新为 4.2），3.7 版本已对错误消息中的用户输入进行 HTML 编码以修复 XSS 漏洞。如使用 4.1+ 版本，建议在编译时通过 `--with-charset=iso-8859-1` 选项指定字符集，防止 IE 浏览器因未指定字符集而触发 XSS。无法升级时，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面配置 `Header set X-Content-Type-Options \"nosniff\"` 并启用 WAF 规则过滤错误页面中的恶意脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0499.html","http://cgiwrap.sourceforge.net/changes.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1909","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3084","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6886","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21023","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0987.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0987","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0987.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0987.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mhfv-4w4f-wrrh/GHSA-mhfv-4w4f-wrrh.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0987.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0987.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0433.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0438","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1010","title":"Sambar Server 4.4/5.0 pagecount 文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.4 及 5.0 版本中存在文件覆盖漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的 pagecount 请求，利用该功能对服务器上的任意文件进行覆盖写入。攻击者无需身份认证即可触发此漏洞，成功利用后可导致网站页面被篡改、敏感文件被覆盖或进一步执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Sambar Server 4.4 和 5.0 版本，攻击条件简单，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1010"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-07-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Sambar Server 至 5.0 beta 5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 pagecount CGI 的路径遍历问题。如无法升级，删除或禁用 /session/pagecount 脚本，或在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 重写规则过滤 page 参数中的 `../` 序列作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21026","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1010.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1010","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1010.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1010.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mwvx-xw2j-2vg6/GHSA-mwvx-xw2j-2vg6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1010.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/sambar_pagecount.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1010.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--46586e05-7c4d-4983-b599-7463cba5683c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0438.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0438.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0438.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0600","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0002","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nAlso I notice the sources in the current TOML is [\"epss\"] which seems wrong - NVD data shows it should probably be [\"cve\"] or similar, but the user said only description needs fixing and other fields are correct. So I should only output the description value.\n\nActually, looking at the task again - it says \"只输出 <value>...","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0002"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2001 年 3 月安全更新 MS01-015，IE 5.01 SP1 用户应用补丁 Q279328 或升级至 IE 5.01 SP2，IE 5.5 SP1 用户应用补丁 Q286045 或升级至 IE 5.5 SP2；同时将 Windows Script Host 5.1 或 5.5 升级至 build 6330 及以上版本。如无法立即安装补丁，应将不可信网站添加至 IE\"受限站点\"区域并禁用 Active Scripting，同时在 Outlook/Outlook Express 中配置 HTML 邮件在\"受限站点\"区域打开，并删除注册表中不必要的异步可插拔协议（如 Telnet）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.guninski.com/chmtempmain.html","http://www.osvdb.org/7823","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2456","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5567","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A920","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0002.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0002.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0002.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2001/CVE-2001-0002.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0002","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0002.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2001/CVE-2001-0002.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0002.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0002.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0002.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0600.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0600.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0544","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1370","title":"PHPLib Team PHPLIB 7.2 远程脚本执行漏洞","description":"PHPLib 团队 PHPLIB 7.2 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，当 PHP 的 register_globals 设置为开启时，攻击者可通过发送 HTTP 请求操纵 $_PHPLIB[libdir]，使其指向攻击者控制的恶意代码服务器，从而执行任意脚本代码。此漏洞影响 Horde 1.2.5 及更早版本、IMP 2.2.6 及更早版本及其他使用 PHPLib 的软件包，当 register_globals 功能未关闭时，将导致远程代码执行的严重安全风险。CVSS 评分 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），危害等级极高。Microsoft 已于 2024 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1370"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:08Z","remediation":"升级 PHPLib 至 7.2d 或更高版本（修复了 prepend.php3 中的远程脚本执行漏洞）。在 php.ini 中设置 register_globals = Off 禁用全局变量注册，这是该漏洞的前置条件。若无法立即升级，可通过 Web 应用防火墙拦截包含 _PHPLIB[libdir] 参数的请求，或在 prepend.php3 中添加输入验证过滤 libdir 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000410","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99616122712122&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/198495","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-073","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6892.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/198768","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3079","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21022","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1370.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1370","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1370.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1370.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qxgr-53mq-mh3m/GHSA-qxgr-53mq-mh3m.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-073.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1370.md","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-073.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0280","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0280.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0514","title":"Netgear ME102 Linksys WAP11 802.11b SNMP协议信息泄露与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Atmel 802.11b VNET-B 接入点 1.3 及更早版本的 SNMP 服务存在漏洞，Netgear ME102 和 Linksys WAP11 等采用该芯片组的设备受影响。该漏洞源于 SNMP 服务未正确验证社区字符串，接受任意社区字符串并允许请求的 MIB 修改操作。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过网络发送恶意 SNMP 请求，利用该漏洞获取敏感信息（如 WEP 加密密钥）、导致拒绝服务或获得网络访问权限。CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0514"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Atmel 802.11b VNET-B Access Point 固件至 1.3 以上版本，Netgear ME102 用户升级至固件 2.1.1 以上，Linksys WAP11 用户升级至固件 1.3 以上版本。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面封锁 UDP 161/162 端口（SNMP 端口），或在无线 AP 管理界面将 SNMP 社区字符串修改为复杂随机字符串并禁用 SNMP 写权限（仅保留只读）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2896","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise83.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6576","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0514.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0514","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0514.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0514.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2001-0514-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-75j3-qq88-rrpc/GHSA-75j3-qq88-rrpc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2014/gb_snmp_get_community.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0514.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0280.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0200","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0500","title":"Microsoft IIS Index Server ISAPI 扩展缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Index Server 2.0 和 Indexing Service 2000 中的 ISAPI 扩展（idq.dll）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，在 IIS 6.0 及更早版本中尤为严重。该漏洞源于在处理 Internet Data Administration (.ida) 和 Internet Data Query (.idq) 文件时，系统未能对用户输入的长度进行有效校验，导致攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的数据包触发缓冲区溢出，致使恶意代码在目标系统中执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 及更早版本的 Microsoft IIS 服务，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程利用此漏洞， CVSS 评分高达 10.0（CVSS 向量：AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），表明其对系统保密性、完整性和可用性的极度严重影响。攻击者可通过构造精心-crafted 的 .idq 文件实现远程代码执行或获取系统控制权。微软已发布安全更新修补了该漏洞，用户应及时应用补丁以确保系统安全。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0500"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:25Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全更新 Q300972（MS01-033），该补丁修复了 idq.dll 在 Index Server 2.0 及 Indexing Service 中处理 .ida 和 .idq 请求时存在的缓冲区溢出漏洞。受影响系统包括 Windows NT 4.0 IIS 4.0 与 Windows 2000 IIS 5.0，补丁已包含在 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 及后续版本中，也可通过 Microsoft Update 或 Windows Update 自动获取。如暂时无法安装补丁，可先在 IIS 管理控制台中删除 .idq 和 .ida 文件的脚本映射作为临时缓解措施，但需注意该映射在系统组件变更时可能自动恢复，因此建议尽快应用补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-13.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-098.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6705.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/191873","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2880","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-033","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A197","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20933","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0500.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0500.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0500","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0500.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gcxg-pq25-8wh2/GHSA-gcxg-pq25-8wh2.json","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iis_ida_isapi.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0199","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0499","title":"Oracle 8i TNS Listener 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle 8i 的透明网络底层（TNS）监听器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 STATUS、PING、SERVICES、TRC_FILE、SAVE_CONFIG 或 RELOAD 等命令发送超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 Oracle 8i 8.1.7 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，攻击者可轻易实现远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0499"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:25Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle 8i 至 9.0.1 及以上版本，或安装 Oracle 2001 年第 2 季度关键补丁集。在 listener.ora 中设置 ADMIN_RESTRICTIONS_LISTENER=ON 并配置监听器密码，限制 TNS Listener 仅接受受信任 IP 的连接，在防火墙上封禁 1521 端口的非授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-16.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/620495","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/050.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2941","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6758","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20980","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0499.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0499.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0499","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0499.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0499.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x55p-rh55-qcxv/GHSA-x55p-rh55-qcxv.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0499.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0148","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0341","title":"Microsoft Visual Studio RAD Support 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 中的 Visual Studio RAD Support 子组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 fp30reg.dll 发送超长注册请求（URL）触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Visual Studio 及 FrontPage Server Extensions 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS03-051 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0341"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:07Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS03-051 提供的更新补丁，或升级至受支持的最新 Windows 版本及 IIS 版本。如无法安装补丁，可在 IIS 中移除 FPSE 扩展映射（删除 .dll 关联）或禁用 FrontPage Server Extensions 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99348216322147&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/577","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2906","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-035","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6730","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20951","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0341.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0341.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0341","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0341.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ppvh-qjhq-qjwm/GHSA-ppvh-qjhq-qjwm.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/97a17708b9a16c731a8a37abc74c9e94d43d7b3f/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0341.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/F/frontpage_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0148.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0148.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0001","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0537","title":"Cisco IOS HTTP配置任意管理访问漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.3 至 12.2 版本的 HTTP 配置服务器存在认证绕过漏洞。当设备启用本地授权（local authorization）时，远程攻击者无需有效凭据，只需在 URL 中指定高访问级别参数即可绕过身份验证机制，直接获取设备的完全管理权限。攻击者可利用该漏洞执行任意命令，完全控制目标路由器或交换机，导致网络基础设施被接管。该漏洞利用方式简单，仅需向目标设备的 HTTP 管理接口发送特制请求即可触发，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0537"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:29Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.2(4) 或更高版本，或禁用 HTTP 服务器（使用 `no ip http server` 命令），改用 HTTPS 并配置 AAA 认证。如必须使用 HTTP，在接口 ACL 中限制仅允许受信管理 IP 访问 80 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-14.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-106.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/IOS-httplevel-pub.html","http://www.osvdb.org/578","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/1601227034.20010702112207%40olympos.org","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/20010703011650.60515.qmail%40web14910.mail.yahoo.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/4.3.2.7.2.20010629095801.0c3e6a70%40brussels.cisco.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/Pine.LNX.3.96.1010702134611.22995B-100000%40Lib-Vai.lib.asu.edu","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2936","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6749","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20978","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2001/CVE-2001-0537.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0537.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2001/CVE-2001-0537.yaml","https://github.com/PortSwigger/BChecks/blob/7117c5ff8d1d47ca6282020a243b4d3026480ad5/vulnerabilities-CVEd/CVE-2001-0537%20CISCO%20Authentication%20Bypass.bcheck","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0537.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2001-0537_5_1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2001-0537_3.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0537.json","https://github.com/rokkamvamshi/attack-surface-management/blob/c988ba43c9b670a9983bbc30e2493422ae577605/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2001/CVE-2001-0537.yaml","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/0fcfb8c0516a8ea2563628979ef2eb68236527b2/data/lists/NucleiList.txt","https://github.com/rishikesh-j/Nuclei-Templates-Scrapped/blob/c1c4a009b3ada12b7923dcbc40e099ce8f224b2c/templates/CVE-2001-0537.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0001.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0577","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0577.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0018","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 消息请求泛洪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 Server、Advanced Server 及 Datacenter Server 的域控制器存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于域控制器上核心服务未正确验证服务请求，攻击者可通过发送大量格式错误的请求数据包，触发服务执行资源密集型的无效处理而非直接丢弃，从而消耗目标系统大量CPU资源。此漏洞仅影响域控制器，不影响成员服务器或工作站。攻击者可导致域控制器无法正常响应合法请求，影响新用户登录、Kerberos票据签发及Active Directory查询。不过攻击不会导致系统崩溃，当攻击流量停止后服务会自动恢复。该漏洞可通过防火墙阻止外部直接访问域控制器来缓解。微软已在安全公告 MS01-011 中发布补丁 Q287397，后续被 MS01-024 取代，Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 已包含修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0018"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-011 补丁 Q287397（已包含于 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3），该补丁使域控制器服务能正确识别并丢弃畸形请求而非消耗 CPU 资源处理。由于 Windows 2000 已终止支持，建议迁移至 Windows Server 2019 或更高受支持版本。临时缓解措施：在防火墙中限制仅允许可信内网访问域控制器端口，部署多台域控制器分担负载，并在网络边缘部署 IDS 过滤畸形服务请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0018.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0018.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0018.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0018","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0018.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0018.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0018.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0018.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2001/CVE-2001-0018.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0018.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0149","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0348","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 服务在处理超长登录命令中的退格符时存在缓冲区处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 Telnet 端口（默认23）发送特制请求，触发服务进程崩溃，导致合法用户无法正常登录。该漏洞源于 Telnet 服务对特殊字符序列的边界检查不充分，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施，影响所有 Windows 2000 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0348"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-031 提供的补丁程序，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 及以上版本。如无需使用 Telnet 服务，建议在服务管理器中禁用 Telnet Service (tlntsvr) 以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_mstelnet.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-092.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2838","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-031","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6666","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20907"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0149.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0542","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0542.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1354","title":"NetWin DMail/SurgeFTP NWAuth 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"NetWin DMail 2.x 及 SurgeFTP 1.0/2.0 等产品使用的 NetWin 认证模块（NWAuth）2.0 和 3.0b 版本采用弱密码哈希算法，本地攻击者可利用该缺陷破解用户密码，或使用与正确密码具有相同哈希值的不同密码绕过认证。该漏洞影响范围包括 SurgeFTP、DMail 及其他集成 NWAuth 的软件，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1354"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:06Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 NetWin DMail 至最新版本（如仍受支持），或迁移至其他支持强密码哈希的 FTP/邮件服务软件。若无法升级，应严格限制本地用户对服务器的交互式登录权限，并对存储加密密码的 admin.dat 和 nwauth.clg 文件设置仅管理员可读（chmod 600），同时启用系统审计日志监控异常密码验证行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/198293","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3075","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6866","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21020","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1354.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1354","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1354.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1354.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvhf-h24r-wq3w/GHSA-vvhf-h24r-wq3w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1354.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c7b653673c3d40fb1d0f389e4e07ce0491eee0d0/2001/CVE-2001-1354.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3075/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0542.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0491","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0491.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1375","title":"Tcl/Tk tcltk 库搜索路径本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Tcl/Tk 8.3.1 版本在加载库文件时存在不安全的搜索路径漏洞，程序会优先在当前工作目录中查找所需库文件，而非系统标准库路径。本地攻击者可通过将特洛伊木马库文件放置在用户可控目录中，诱使 tcl/tk 程序加载恶意库文件，从而执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 tcl/tk 8.3.1 的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1375"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:08Z","remediation":"升级 tcl/tk 至 8.3.3 及以上版本（Red Hat 已通过 RHSA-2002:148 修复此问题）。对于仍在使用旧版 tcl/tk 的系统，应安装对应发行版的安全更新补丁。临时缓解措施：避免在不受信任的目录中执行 tcl/tk 脚本，或通过设置环境变量 TCLLIBPATH 限制库搜索路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000409","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6869.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:060","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-148.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3073","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=28226","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1375.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1375","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1375.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q93x-935r-q53x/GHSA-q93x-935r-q53x.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1375.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-060.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1375.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4c4207e1-f1c9-4677-b542-04ef57de17ca.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-060.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0491.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0488","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0488.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1374","title":"TCL/TK expect 不安全的库搜索路径本地权限提升漏洞","description":"TCL/TK 套件中的 expect 工具（版本低于 5.32）存在不安全的库搜索路径漏洞。expect 在搜索动态库时优先查找 /var/tmp 目录而非系统标准库路径，本地攻击者可通过在 /var/tmp 目录中放置恶意的特洛伊木马库文件，当特权用户（如 root）运行 mkpasswd 等 expect 脚本时，程序会优先加载恶意库，从而导致攻击者获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 expect 5.32 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1374"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:08Z","remediation":"升级 expect 至 5.32 或更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-200 提供的更新包，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:060 更新。如无法立即升级，可删除 /var/tmp 目录中不受信任的共享库文件，或限制本地用户对 /var/tmp 的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000409","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:060","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-148.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3074","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=22187","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=28224","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6870","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1374.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1374.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1374","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xp42-65qj-mvgv/GHSA-xp42-65qj-mvgv.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1374.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1374.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-060.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--eee553d1-e7fb-40ac-9afc-e061c3e4c485.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0488.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0517","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0517.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1303","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 SecuRemote 网络信息泄露漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 的 SecuRemote 组件默认配置存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过发送特制请求获取受保护网络的敏感配置信息，包括网络拓扑、防火墙规则等内部细节。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 4.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者可利用泄露的信息进一步规划针对性攻击，扩大攻击面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1303"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:00Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point Firewall-1 至 4.1 及以上版本，该版本默认禁用未认证拓扑下载。如无法升级，在 Firewall-1 管理控制台中取消勾选 \"Allow unauthenticated cleartext topology downloads\" 选项，并在网络边界防火墙规则中限制对 TCP 端口 256 和 264 的外部访问，仅允许受信任的 SecureRemote 客户端 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/588","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/197566","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3058","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6857","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21015","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1303.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1303","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1303.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1303.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvv6-qm6w-jpjw/GHSA-gvv6-qm6w-jpjw.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/ro